<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <!-- Deconstruct refund is costList times resourcesFractionWhenDeconstructed.
       These debris defs have no cost list, so the default 50% refunds nothing.
       Fraction 1 makes the counts below the actual refund.
       AncientCardboardBox is left unchanged: cardboard has no resource. -->

